.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt VULKANINFO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vulkaninfo
.Nd show Vulkan information
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     vulkaninfo
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     The vulkaninfo program shows information about the supported Vulkan
     capabilities. It lists not only device properties and features, but also
     supported Vulkan layers and extensions.
.Ed
